# Trial by Wind (outlands 194): the battlefield won while accepted. With the Tuning Fork of Wind, at WP_Entrance the
# fork opens the entry menu 32000; its update with option 1 (index 0, arena 1) registers and enters (the fork taken);
# Garuda_Prime_TBW of arena 1 (OGMIOS-3: mob 17600513; OGMIOS is 17600516) is
# killed, and the win's 32001 opens within the kill step. Its finish runs content:onEventFinishWin, which calls this
# quest: Heir of the Great Wind, the Whisper of Gales. In Rabao, Agado-Pugado's 69 (the whisper, no fork) and option 5
# (10000 gil) complete it.
char zone=CloisterOfGales pos=-357.6,-0.1,-380.0 job=WAR lvl=75
quest Outlands.TrialByWind accepted
keyitem TuningForkOfWind
login
trigger WP_Entrance                       # the fork: the entry menu 32000
update 32000 option=1                     # Trial by Wind (index 0), arena 1: registered, entered, the fork taken
finish                                    # in the arena
kill OGMIOS-3                             # Garuda_Prime_TBW of arena 1: the battlefield won, 32001 opens
finish                                    # Heir of the Great Wind, the Whisper of Gales
warp -16.5,7.8,-10.5 Rabao
trigger Agado-Pugado                      # the whisper, no fork: 69
finish option=5                           # 10000 gil: completed
